{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T16:55:16+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-28T16:55:16+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"MPC Container Ships ASA","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Marine Shipping","country":"Norway","city":"Oslo","website":"https://www.mpc-container.com","employees":40,"summary":"MPC Container Ships ASA, together with its subsidiaries, owns and operates a portfolio of container vessels in Intra-Asia, South America, Europe, the Middle East, Africa, and internationally. The company invests in maritime assets; and charters out small- to mid-size vessels through time-charter agreements to global liner shipping companies and regional carriers serving intra-regional trade lanes, as well as operates and sells vessels. It serves charterers and port calls. As of December 31, 2025, the company operated a fleet of 51 vessels with an aggregate capacity of approximately 129,192 twenty-foot equivalent units. MPC Container Ships ASA was incorporated in 2017 and is headquartered in Oslo, Norway.","exchange":"Oslo","currency":"NOK","financial_currency":"USD","summary_fr":"MPC Container Ships ASA, avec ses filiales, possède et exploite un portefeuille de navires porte-conteneurs en Intra-Asie, en Amérique du Sud, en Europe, au Moyen-Orient, en Afrique et à l’international. La société investit dans des actifs maritimes; et affrète des navires de petite à moyenne taille par le biais d'accords de location de temps aux compagnies maritimes de ligne mondiales et aux transporteurs régionaux desservant les voies commerciales intrarégionales, ainsi que exploite et vend des navires. Il dessert les affréteurs et les escales.","summary_fr_excerpt":true},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":13661087744,"shares_outstanding":488070306,"trailing_pe":6.0453563,"forward_pe":8.523864,"price_to_book":1.3257748,"ev_to_ebitda":48.744,"ev_to_revenue":28.169,"dividend_yield":0.053600002,"